{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:79ba5b865fa46b20","name":"Ascension Gun","source":{"id":"source:reference-79ba5b865fa46b20","title":"Ascension Gun","revision":15933,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:27Z","sha256":"60d86aee0fc38a7f99b37a29fa297997aad12049705a10904b66455f32096a12","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15933","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ascension%20Gun&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-79ba5b865fa46b20","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Ascension Gun is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:7fb29dca115dd7cd"}," with a special ",{"tag":"a","children":["Syntherope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Syntherope","referenceId":"reference:021cc9389a913882"}," tether and a grappling-dart launcher attached. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can switch the weapon from Blaster mode to Ascension mode. When fired in Ascension mode, the weapon shoots a grappling dart attached to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Syntherope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Syntherope","referenceId":"reference:021cc9389a913882"},", tethering the weapon to the target. If the tether is projected vertically, the Ascension Gun can pull the wielder upward at a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," of 12 squares per round, with a maximum vertical lift capacity of roughly 720 kg.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An Ascension Gun can also be used to create a zipline to a target surface after the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Syntherope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Syntherope","referenceId":"reference:021cc9389a913882"}," has been secured to a fixed object at the shooter's location. The zipline allows the wielder to slide along the line at a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," of 12 squares per round if the destination has a lower elevation. In Ascension mode, the Ascension Gun has a maximum Range of 30 squares (45 meters).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In Blaster mode, an Ascension Gun functions like a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:7fb29dca115dd7cd"},". Ascension Guns are somewhat bulkier than other Weapons of the same size, imposing a -5 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks made to conceal the weapon.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An Ascension Gun requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 50 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced. Additionally, the Ascension Gun carries only two lengths of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Syntherope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Syntherope","referenceId":"reference:021cc9389a913882"},"; after 2 uses, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Syntherope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Syntherope","referenceId":"reference:021cc9389a913882"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
